{
  "name": "Grappling Attacks",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Creatures no more than one size larger than your Eidolon that are hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks have to make a STR or DEX Saving Throw (target creature's choice) against your spell save DC. On failure, the target creature is Grappled by your Eidolon. Creatures that are the same size of the Eidolon or smaller, are also Restrained while Grappled in this manner.</p>",
